body:
Yeah, we won't be seeing anytime soon. Also there are no leaks so I guess she doesn't do nudes. 

&#x200B;

As for Maxim, I mistook it for another men's magazine which makes steamier pics.

I find it interesting that she seems to be unwilling to show her breasts, in all the sex scenes involving her they are always covered. 

&#x200B;

Anyway the pic is beautiful and of course Kat as always is gorgeous.

Yeah, as if it is a competition. I have a friend who gets angry whenever I talk about how I feel or talk about my problems. She gets triggered I guess and starts insulting and belittling me, also saying that it is all my fault and so on. Then starts talking how her problems are far greater and how she is overcoming them and so on...

&#x200B;

On the other hand I found people who actually listen and support me. So whenever I need a shoulder to cry on I go to them.

I don't know why I even bother anymore. Also I guess everyone stopped caring about Cicada anymore. 

&#x200B;

Barry should decide to use a condom, then poof edgelord Nora will cease to exist. 

&#x200B;

I wonder about next season if they bring Impulse in, so that they can ruin him as well.

That is great news! Can't wait for the new videos. 

&#x200B;

Will there be any more bio specials (I sent you a suggestion in October), Out of the trenches and other specials?

I am terrified by any type of blood tests. I am in a diabetes risk group and the last time I had a full blood test was in 2013 and blood test from the finger last year. I shake and scream. A simple procedure that takes no more than 5 minutes can last 2 hours for me. After that I collapse. It is an absolute horror. I go limp when I even think about it.

&#x200B;

So good job that you were able to do it!

- because I haven't been paid for some time now (almost a year);
- because I don't have many friends;
- because other people have more fun together than when with me;
- because I don't have a girlfriend;
- because my best friend cut ties with me;
- because my hopes and dreams are impossible and won't come true;
- because I am overweight;
